%% Title: UX state flow
%% Purpose: Show UI states and transitions for a screen or component.
%% Assumptions:
%% - Default state is reachable after initial load succeeds.
%% Open questions:
%% - Confirm permission and partial-data states.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading
    Loading --> Empty: no items
    Loading --> Default: items found
    Loading --> Error: request fails
    Empty --> Create: user starts setup
    Create --> Default: item created
    Default --> Refreshing: user refreshes
    Refreshing --> Default: success
    Refreshing --> Error: failure
    Error --> Loading: retry
